  "title": {
   "en": "Kyou mo Tsukiyo ni Kimi no Mesh"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "今日も月夜に君のめし"
   },
   {
    "en": "Tonight as Well, Your Moonlit Meal"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nana Kotake, who works at a milk delivery company, doesn't like to eat alone. But her boyfriend, who she lives with, gradually stops coming home, and she has to eat ready-made meals in an empty room. As she continues to work overtime, her slightly strict junior colleague Ogaya, who is also staying at the same place, can't stand to see Kotake's tiredness and suggests that they cook together...!?\n\nWhat to eat, who to eat with. A gourmet x love story that deals with loneliness through food!"
  },
